@bank all
// SW1 (2026-10-25, patch 0.92.6 items 18, 14 and 11, for FX19's worksText): the first promotion made obvious. The
// Tier 1 steps are New, Steady, Reliable, Trusted, Relied on; the Tier 2 test needs Relied on and Making it safe, from
// Day 8. Calder speaks unless noted: exact, numbers not adjectives, never "well done" (her arc's payoff) and no "!".
// Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender). Each beat fires once.

// toasts, said by nobody, when your reputation word changes at Tier 1 ({band})
== works.rep.up.reliable
- Up to Reliable. Trusted, then Relied on, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.
== works.rep.up.trusted
- Up to Trusted. One more step, Relied on, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.

// Calder, at Reliable, if she's near (a bubble); else the Mail
== promo.sight
- Reliable. Good. Two more steps and Making it safe, and I'll put you up for Tier 2.
- Reliable now. Trusted next, then Relied on. Making it safe with me. Then your test.
== promo.sight.mail
- Your next step | Reliable. Then Trusted, Relied on, Making it safe. Then Tier 2.

// Calder, at Trusted (short)
== promo.trusted
- Trusted. One more step. Then we talk about your test.

// the big beat: Relied on + Making it safe + Day 8 or later (her bubble; promo.announce follows it)
== promo.ready
- People rely on your work. Making it safe is done. That's all of it. Tier 2 test.
// the Mail, always ({day}: a weekday or "tomorrow")
== promo.ready.mail
- Your Tier 2 test | You're ready. Test job {day}, 09:00, Works bay. Pass it: Officer.
// the device's urgent notice ({day})
== promo.ready.notice
- Your Tier 2 test: {day}, 09:00, the Works bay.

// Mail once: Relied on, but Making it safe not done
== promo.missing.m6
- Almost | Relied on. One thing left before your Tier 2 test: Making it safe, with me.
// Mail once: qualified before Day 8
== promo.missing.day
- Soon | You're ready early. I set Tier 2 tests from the second Monday. We'll talk then.

// the Record's "What's next" while you're below Relied on ({band} now, {next} the next step's word)
== next.t2.rep
- Your Tier 2 test needs Relied on and Making it safe. You're {band}. Next: {next}.
// the same, with the steps left ({steps}), when FX19's switch is on
== next.t2.steps
- Tier 2 test: Relied on and Making it safe. You're {band}, {steps} steps away. Next: {next}.

// the Works app's Training tab, "Your promotion" checklist
== works.promo.check.title
- Your promotion: the Tier 2 test
== works.promo.check.day
- From Day 8
== works.promo.check.rep
- Relied on (you're {band})
== works.promo.check.m6
- Making it safe, with the Chief
== works.promo.check.set
- Test job: {day}, 09:00
== works.promo.check.done
- Done
== works.promo.check.not
- Not yet

// Calder's Mail, the first time your ship-wide work reputation turns dependable
== promo.dependable
- Dependable | Word is you're dependable. Keep it up. Then we talk about your Tier 2 test.

// optional (item 11): the chip on board jobs of a kind you're trained in
== works.board.trade
- Your trade
